<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Budget reinforces lower rates pressure-Howard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Budget reinforces lower rates pressure-Howard.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Prime Minister John Howard said on Friday the government's budget for the year to June 30, 1998 reinforced pressure for lower interest rates.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe the budget is sound in all the important economic elements. It will reinforce the pressure for lower interest rates within the Australian economy,&quot; Howard said.</p>
</text>
